<.shell title="Empty state" current={:empty_state}>
  <h1>Empty state</h1>
  <p class="lead">Why a list is empty and what to do.</p>
  <.used_on />

  <div class="example">
    <div class="empty-state">
      <strong>No tax credit letters for 2025 yet</strong>
      <p>Letters are made from attendance in D4H. Create one from the member list.</p>
      <.button size={:sm} href="#">Go to tax credit letters</.button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>When to use</h2>
  <p>A list that people expect to have rows, such as letters for a new year.</p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>Say why it's empty and what to do, not only "No results". Link to the place to do it.</p>

  <h2>In the app</h2>
  <p>
    <code>&lt;div class="empty-state"&gt;</code>. Today empty lists say so in a line of text.
  </p>
</.shell>
